== 4. Melanoma lines by subtype ================================
  melanoma models in annotation: 154
    Melanoma NOS      109
    Cutaneous          20
    Uveal              16
    Acral               6
    Mucosal             3

  'Melanoma NOS' is skin melanoma of unstated subtype. It is NOT verified
  to exclude acral or mucosal cases, so it is reported as its own group
  rather than counted as cutaneous.

== 5. Gate under each collapse rule ============================
  The MAX column is the decisive one: it is >= whichever profile DepMap
  would have designated, so it is the most generous possible reading.

  RASSF9  (non-uveal melanoma lines with expression, n = 113)
