    first     113     3.5%    27.4%    0.022   0.315    1.89    26.5%   STOP
    max       113     3.5%    26.5%    0.022   0.315    1.89    25.7%   STOP
    mean      113     3.5%    26.5%    0.022   0.315    1.89    25.7%   STOP
    lines whose value rose > 0.5 log2 units under max: 0
    lines crossing the TPM >= 1 threshold under max  : 0

